          "text": "In the coders channel, a few new members introduced themselves and asked questions about getting started. One user noted they were new to the community. Another user named Issa introduced themselves as a digital artist offering skills in animations and banners, asking if the team needed an artist or co-artist. A third user asked how to get started contributing to eliza.army and whether there were any starter documentation available, to which another community member confirmed that documentation exists. The channel topic directs users to the ElizaOS documentation site at docs.elizaos.ai to get started. The general discussion channel had no messages during this period.",
